        "id": 221495,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-31T21:26:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think he meant that that's just how he played it at his table because it was expedient, not because that was strictly according to the rules.&nbsp; A lot of other folks have posted, here and on Reddit, that they did the same.&nbsp; Until Benchmark and La Comodora, it didn't make a whole lot of difference.&nbsp; Some, but not enough to really worry about.</p>",
